       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TOPNRCV.
       AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
      *INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   MARCH 1985.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *SECURITY.
      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*
      *D*      INVOICING OPEN RECEIVERS REPORT.
      *D*
      *D*      THIS PROGRAM WILL PRINT OPEN RECEIVERS ON
      *D*      PURCHASE ORDERS BASED ON CRITERIA THAT THE
      *D*      USER HAS SELECTED.  THE OPTIONS ALLOWED ARE:
      *D*          "ALL" OR UP TO 5 SELECTIONS OF
      *D*                1.  CLASS
      *D*                2.  SUBD
      *D*                3.  ADDITIONAL DATA
      *D*
      *D*      THE USER THEN HAS THE OPTION OF SORTING THE
      *D*      REPORT BY HIS SELECTION OR BY PO NUMBER.
      *D*     THE USER ALSO ENTERS THE YEAR AND ENDING MONTH
      *D*     FOR THIS REPORT.  ANY RECEIVING SLIPS WITH A
      *D*     PAST THIS ENTERED DATE WILL NOT BE INCLUDED IN
      *D*     THE REPORT.
      *D*
      *D*     THE REPORT IS PRINTED TO A DISC FILE.  THE JOB
      *D*     STREAM THAT RUNS THIS PROGRAM SETS THE SPOOLER
      *D*     TYPE AND PRINTER NUMBER AND THEN RUNS A PROGRAM
      *D*     CALLED "XPRTRPT".  THIS IS DONE SO THAT EACH
      *D*     PLANT MAY HAVE THEIR OWN JOB STREAM AND CAN
      *D*     ASSIGN THE REPORT TO ANY PRINTER THEY WISH.
      *D*     "XPRTRPT" ALSO HAS THE ABILITY TO COMPRESS THE
      *D*     132 CHARACTER REPORT TO FIT ON AN 80-COLUMN PRINTER.
      *D*
      *D* CALLING PROGRAM:    TRSCREEN
      *D* PASSED PARAMETERS:  1.  SELECTION
      *D*                     2.  ALL OPTION     ("A"=ALL)
      *D*                     3.  5 CHOICES      (ONLY IF NOT ALL)
      *D*                     4.  SORT OPTION
      *D*                     5.  MONTH END CLOSING DATE
      *D*
      *D*
      *D* CALLED PROGRAMS:  TBLOWUP   (ABORTS PROGRAM CLEANLY)
      *D*                   THDPRT2    (PRINTS REPORT HEADER)
      *D*                   TDATECHK  (FORMATS U.S./EUROPEAN DATE)
      *D*
      *C* CHANGES.
      *C*    NOV 18, 1993     CR KALMAN
      *C*    NOT ENTERING THE CLOSING DATE ON THE SCREEN "OPNRCV"
      *C*    IN ZRSCREEN CAUSED THIS PROGRAM TO BLOWUP ON A DECIMAL
      *C*    DATA ERROR.  TO FIX THIS THE PROGRAM WILL NOW TRY TO
      *C*    GET THE CLOSING DATE FROM MACCOUNT-INFO IF THE USER
      *C*    ENTERS NOTHING.
      *C
      *C     06/10/96         JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     FIGURE CENTURY FOR DATE ENTERED.  YEAR > 70 THEN 19
      *C     ELSE 20.  CHANGE COMPARE OF DATE FROM YYMM TO CCYYMM
      *C     FOR DATE RECEIVED.  CHANGE SORT RECORDS TO INCLUDE
      *C     CENTURY.
      ***************************************************************
      ***************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
             SELECT DISC-PRT     ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
             SELECT SORTED-PRINT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTED.
             SELECT SORT-FILE          ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

             SELECT DPOITEM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DPORECD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DRCVITEM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MPORCV-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
9311CK     SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO-I
  .               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
  .               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
  .               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
  .               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
9311CK            FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
