      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      *        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
      *     READ ALL RECORDS FROM DPOITEM AND DPONSITM. COMPARE    *
      *     OPTION (CLASS, SUBD, OR ADDTL) WITH THE RECORD DATA.    *
      *     IF USER SELECTED ALL, IT REALLY DOESN'T MATTER WHICH   *
      *     OPTION WAS SELECTED BECAUSE ALL RECORDS WILL BE        *
      *     PROCESSED.  WRITE EACH SELECTED ENTRY INTO A FILE      *
      *     THAT WILL LATER BE SORTED.                             *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA, DATA-LINE.
       00-MAIN.
           MOVE "TOPNRCV"                  TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           PERFORM 010-OPEN-FILES          THRU 019-EXIT.
           PERFORM 030-GET-PARAMETERS      THRU 039-EXIT.
           PERFORM 100-READ-ITEMS    THRU 199-EXIT.
           PERFORM 300-SORT                THRU 399-EXIT.
           PERFORM 400-PRINT-REPORT        THRU 499-EXIT.
           PERFORM 020-CLOSE-FILES         THRU 029-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
      *************************************************************
      *           OPEN DATABASE AND PRINT FILE                    *
      *************************************************************
       010-OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT DPORECD-I MSTORERM-I DPOITEM-I DRCVITEM-I
                      MPORCV-I  MACCOUNT-INFO-I.

      *----------  BUILD NEW TEMP FILE
      *    MOVE SPACES TO COMMAND.
      *    MOVE "BUILD INVDISC.PUB;DISC=20000,32,1;REC=-133,25,F,ASCII;T
      *-           "EMP" TO COMMAND.
      *    CALL INTRINSIC "COMMAND" USING COMMAND-IMAGE, COMMAND-ERROR,
      *                                   COMMAND-PARM.
      *    IF COMMAND-ERROR NOT = 0
      *       MOVE COMMAND TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *       MOVE "COMMAND INTRINSIC FAILED" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
      *       MOVE COMMAND-ERROR              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (1)
      *       MOVE COMMAND-PARM               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (2)
      *       PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
      *----- CALL CCRTFILE TO CREATE A TEMPORARY FILE FOR SORTING
      *----- LIBRARY 'QTEMP' IS USED FOR TEMPORARY FILES
           MOVE SPACES        TO CCRTFILE-PARMS.
           MOVE "QTEMP"       TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY.
           MOVE "SORTED"      TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           MOVE "0088"        TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH.
           MOVE "90000"       TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS.
           MOVE "02000"       TO CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT.
           MOVE "10"          TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                 CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                 CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                 CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                 CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CCRTFILE CREATE OF 'SORTED' FAILED"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
      *----------  OPEN OUTPUT FILE
           OPEN OUTPUT SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
       019-EXIT.  EXIT.

      *************************************************************
      *               CLOSE DATABASE AND PRINT FILE               *
      *************************************************************
       020-CLOSE-FILES.
           CLOSE DISC-PRT, SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
           CLOSE DPORECD-I MSTORERM-I DPOITEM-I DRCVITEM-I
                      MPORCV-I MACCOUNT-INFO-I.
       029-EXIT.  EXIT.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *   ACCEPT TWO LINES OF DATA: 1) ALL HEADER INFORMATION -   *
      *     WHO AND WHERE THIS REPORT WILL BE ROUTED TO  2) ALL   *
      *     REPORT OPTIONS.                                       *
      *   THE FOLLOWING FLAGS ARE SET ACCORDING TO THE OPTIONS    *
      *     THE USER SELECTED:                                    *
      *          1.  ACCEPT-OPTION  -  RECORD RETRIEVAL BY        *
      *                     OPTION.  "1"=CLASS; "2"=SUB DETAIL;   *
      *                     "3"=ADDITIONAL DATA.                  *
      *          2.  ACCEPT-ALL-FLAG - "A"=RETRIEVE ALL RECORDS;  *
      *                     SPACE=RETRIEVE ONLY SELECTED RECORDS. *
      *          3.  ACCEPT-CHOICE  -  5 ENTRIES.  BLANK IF "A"   *
      *                     WAS CHOSEN ABOVE; CONTAINS UP TO 5    *
      *                     CHOICES IF ALL WAS NOT CHOSEN.        *
      *          4.  ACCEPT-SORT  -  SORT OPTION.  "1"=SORT BY    *
      *                     PO NUMBER; "2"=SORT BY OPTION.    *
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       030-GET-PARAMETERS.
           MOVE 70 TO LINE-CTR.
           IF DATA-CLASS NOT = " "
              MOVE "1" TO ACCEPT-OPTION
           ELSE
              IF DATA-SUB-DET NOT = " "
                 MOVE "2" TO ACCEPT-OPTION
              ELSE
                 MOVE "3" TO ACCEPT-OPTION.
           MOVE ENTRIES TO ACCEPT-ENTRIES.
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (1) = "ALL"
              MOVE "A" TO ACCEPT-ALL-FLAG.
           IF DATA-PO = "X"
              MOVE "1" TO ACCEPT-SORT
           ELSE
              MOVE "2" TO ACCEPT-SORT.

      *----------  DO NOT COMPARE FOR BLANK OPTIONS
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (1) = SPACES
              MOVE "??????" TO ACCEPT-CHOICE (1).
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (2) = SPACES
              MOVE "??????" TO ACCEPT-CHOICE (2).
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (3) = SPACES
              MOVE "??????" TO ACCEPT-CHOICE (3).
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (4) = SPACES
              MOVE "??????" TO ACCEPT-CHOICE (4).
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (5) = SPACES
              MOVE "??????" TO ACCEPT-CHOICE (5).

      *----CHECK THAT THE MONTH END CLOSING DATE WAS ENTERED
      *----IF NOT GET IT FROM MACCOUNT-INFO.

           DISPLAY "ENTERED-DATE BEFORE = " ENTERED-DATE.
           IF ENTERED-DATE NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "MTED" TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-I
              READ MACCOUNT-INFO-I INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-READ
              IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                 MOVE "READ MACCOUNT-INFO*030-GP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE "MTED MISSING" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT
              END-IF
              MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE (1:4) TO ENTERED-DATE.
           DISPLAY "ENTERED-DATE AFTER  = " ENTERED-DATE.
           MOVE ENTERED-DATE TO ENTERED-DATE-YM.
           IF ENTERED-DATE-YY > 70
               MOVE 19 TO ENTERED-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO ENTERED-DATE-CC.

       039-EXIT.  EXIT.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *       READ ALL OF DPOITEM ENTRIES AND USE ONLY THE        *
      *       RECORDS THE USER SELECTED.                          *
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       100-READ-ITEMS.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DPOITEM, MODE2, STATUS-AREA,
      *                 ALL-ITEM-LIST, BUF-DPOITEM, DUMMY-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           START DPOITEM-I KEY IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL
                           PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF END-OF-FILE
              GO TO 199-EXIT.

       102-READ-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              GO TO 199-EXIT.

           IF END-OF-FILE
              GO TO 199-EXIT.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBGET DPOITEM AT 100 IN TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

      *----------  CANNOT PAY ON A BLANKET SO IGNORE ALL "999" RELEASES
           MOVE ITM-PO-RCV-NO TO PO-WORK-AREA, PO-ARG.
           IF PO-WORK-RLS = "999"
              GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.

           MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE TO CORPCODE-ARG.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, MSTORERM, MODE7, STATUS-AREA,
      *                 ALL-ITEM-LIST, BUF-MSTORERM, CORPCODE-ARG.

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CORPCODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBGET MSTORERM AT 107 IN TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

      *----------  DETERMINE WHICH RECORDS SHOULD BE SELECTED
           IF ALL-ITEMS
              GO TO 115-WRITE-ENTRY.
           IF CLASS-OPTION
              IF STR-CLASS = ACCEPT-CHOICE (1) OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (2) OR
                             ACCEPT-CHOICE (3) OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (4) OR
                             ACCEPT-CHOICE (5)
                    GO TO 115-WRITE-ENTRY
              ELSE
                    GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.
           IF SUBD-OPTION
              IF ITM-SUB-DETL = ACCEPT-CHOICE (1) OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (2)
                            OR  ACCEPT-CHOICE (3) OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (4)
                            OR  ACCEPT-CHOICE (5)
                    GO TO 115-WRITE-ENTRY
              ELSE
                    GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.
           IF ADDTL-OPTION
              IF ITM-ADDL-DATA = ACCEPT-CHOICE (1) OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (2)
                              OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (3) OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (4)
                              OR ACCEPT-CHOICE (5)
                    GO TO 115-WRITE-ENTRY
              ELSE
                    GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.
       115-WRITE-ENTRY.
           MOVE DISPLAY-PO            TO SRTD-PO.
           MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE         TO SRTD-CODE.
           MOVE ITM-SUB-DETL          TO SRTD-SUB-DET.
           MOVE ITM-ADDL-DATA         TO SRTD-ADDL-DATA.
           MOVE ITM-UM                TO SRTD-UM.
           MOVE ITM-NUMBER            TO SRTD-ITEM.
           MOVE ITM-DATE-RCVD-CN      TO SRTD-DATE-RCVD-CN.

           MOVE ITM-CLASS                TO SRTD-SUB-CLASS.
           IF ITM-CLASS = "    "
             IF ITM-CORP-CODE NOT = "NON-STR"
              MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE TO CORPCODE-ARG
              PERFORM 800-READ-MSTORERM THRU 809-EXIT
              IF GOOD-CALL
                 MOVE STR-CLASS          TO SRTD-SUB-CLASS.
           MOVE ZEROES TO TOTAL-PAST-ENDING-MONTH.

      *----------  GET VENDOR CODE
           MOVE "000"                 TO PO-WORK-RCV.
           MOVE PO-WORK-AREA TO PO-WORK-AREA2.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-WORK-AREA2 TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC-I.
           START DPORECD-I KEY = PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBFIND DPORECD AT 115 IN TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPORECD-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBGET DPORECD AT 115 IN TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

      ***************************************************
      *  IF PO IS NON-RECEIVABLE THEN EXCLUDE FROM REPORT
      ***************************************************

           IF PO-NON-RCV-INDIC NOT = SPACES
               GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.

           MOVE PO-VEN-CODE1-7        TO SRTD-VENDOR.

      *---------- MAKE SURE QTY AND PRICE UM'S MATCH
           MOVE ITM-QTY-PAID     TO SAVE-QTY-PAID.
           IF ITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
              IF ITM-UNIT-PRICE = ZEROS
                 GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.

           IF ITM-UNIT-PRICE = ZEROS
               MOVE STR-AVG-COST  TO  SAVE-UNIT-PRICE
               MOVE STR-UM        TO  SAVE-PRICE-UM
           ELSE
               MOVE ITM-PRICE-UM  TO SAVE-PRICE-UM
               MOVE ITM-UNIT-PRICE TO SAVE-UNIT-PRICE.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-DLVR     TO SAVE-QTY-DLVR.

           PERFORM 120-CHECK-FOR-MONTH THRU 129-EXIT.
           SUBTRACT TOTAL-PAST-ENDING-MONTH FROM SAVE-QTY-DLVR.
           SUBTRACT SAVE-QTY-PAID FROM SAVE-QTY-DLVR
                    GIVING SRTD-UNPAID ROUNDED, WS-UNPAID ROUNDED.

      *----------  CHECK IF ITEM IS OPEN
           IF SRTD-UNPAID = 0
              GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.

           PERFORM 180-CONVERT-UM     THRU 189-EXIT.
           MOVE ZEROS            TO  SRTD-DLVR.
           ADD SAVE-QTY-DLVR  TO  SRTD-DLVR ROUNDED.
           MULTIPLY WS-TEMP BY SAVE-UNIT-PRICE
               GIVING SRTD-VALUE ROUNDED.
           WRITE SRTD-RECORD.
           GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.

       120-CHECK-FOR-MONTH.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-WORK-AREA TO PORCVNO OF MPORCV-REC-I.
           READ MPORCV-I INTO BUF-MPORCV
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NO-ENTRY
              GO TO 129-EXIT.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBGET MPORCV 115 TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           IF M-PO-LAST-RCVR NUMERIC
               MOVE M-PO-LAST-RCVR  TO  PO-RCV2
           ELSE
               GO TO 129-EXIT.

           IF PO-RCV2 = ZEROS
               GO TO 129-EXIT.

       122-READ-RCVR.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-WORK-AREA2  TO PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC-I.
           START DRCVITEM-I KEY = PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NO-ENTRY
              GO TO 125-GET-NEXT-RCVR.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBFIND DRCVITEM 122 TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

       124-READ-RCVR-ITEMS.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DRCVITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DRCVITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC-I NOT = PO-WORK-AREA2
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF END-OF-CHAIN
              GO TO 125-GET-NEXT-RCVR.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DBGET DRCVITEM 124 TOPNRCV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
           IF RCV-ITEM-NUMBER NOT = SRTD-ITEM
              GO TO 124-READ-RCVR-ITEMS.
           IF RCV-DD-RCVD = SPACES
              MOVE ZEROES TO RCVR-DATE
           ELSE
              MOVE RCV-DATE-RCVD-CN TO RCVR-DATE-WS.
           IF RCVR-DATE > ENTERED-DATE-CYM
              ADD RCV-QTY-DLVR TO TOTAL-PAST-ENDING-MONTH
           ELSE
               GO TO 129-EXIT.

       125-GET-NEXT-RCVR.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM PO-RCV2.
           IF PO-RCV2 = ZEROS
              GO TO 129-EXIT.
           GO TO 122-READ-RCVR.
       129-EXIT.  EXIT.

      *----------  CONVERT ORDERED QTY TO PRICE QTY
       180-CONVERT-UM.
           IF SRTD-UM = SAVE-PRICE-UM
              MOVE WS-UNPAID TO WS-TEMP
              GO TO 189-EXIT.
           IF SRTD-UM = STR-UM
              IF SAVE-PRICE-UM = STR-UM1
               DIVIDE WS-UNPAID BY STR-UM1-CF GIVING WS-TEMP ROUNDED
              ELSE
               DIVIDE WS-UNPAID BY STR-UM2-CF GIVING WS-TEMP ROUNDED
           ELSE
           IF SAVE-PRICE-UM = STR-UM
              IF SRTD-UM = STR-UM1
                 MULTIPLY WS-UNPAID BY STR-UM1-CF
                          GIVING WS-TEMP ROUNDED
              ELSE
                 MULTIPLY WS-UNPAID BY STR-UM2-CF
                          GIVING WS-TEMP ROUNDED
           ELSE
              IF SAVE-PRICE-UM = STR-UM1
               DIVIDE STR-UM2-CF BY STR-UM1-CF
                        GIVING C-ALT-CF ROUNDED
               MULTIPLY WS-UNPAID BY C-ALT-CF GIVING WS-TEMP ROUNDED
              ELSE
               DIVIDE STR-UM1-CF BY STR-UM2-CF GIVING C-ALT-CF ROUNDED
               MULTIPLY WS-UNPAID BY C-ALT-CF GIVING WS-TEMP ROUNDED.
       189-EXIT.  EXIT.
       199-EXIT.  EXIT.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *          SORT THE SORT FILE BY PO NUMBER OR           *
      *          BY THE OPTION THE USER SELECTED.                 *
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       300-SORT.
           CLOSE SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
           IF PO-SORT
              SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-PO
                                              SORT-ITEM
                                              SORT-SUB-CLASS
                                              SORT-SUB-DET
                                              SORT-ADDL-DATA
                   USING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
                   GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
              GO TO 399-EXIT.

           IF CLASS-OPTION
              SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-SUB-CLASS
                                              SORT-PO
                                              SORT-ITEM
                   USING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
                   GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
              GO TO 399-EXIT.

           IF SUBD-OPTION
              SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-SUB-DET
                                              SORT-PO
                                              SORT-ITEM
                   USING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
                   GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
              GO TO 399-EXIT.

           IF ADDTL-OPTION
              SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-ADDL-DATA
                                              SORT-PO
                                              SORT-ITEM
                   USING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
                   GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
              GO TO 399-EXIT.

       399-EXIT.  EXIT.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *        PRINT THE REPORT.  SEPARATE BREAKS OF SELECTED     *
      *        OPTION WITH 3 BLANK LINES, NOT WITH A NEW PAGE     *
      *        SINCE THIS REPORT HAS THE POTENTIAL OF BEING HUGE. *
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       400-PRINT-REPORT.
      *---------- OPEN THE PRINT FILE, GET THE FILE NUMBER OF THE PRINT
      *---------- FILE, AND PRINT THE HEADER PAGE.
           OPEN INPUT SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
      *----------  SET UP PRINTER ESCAPE SEQUENCES
           CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
           MOVE CHAR-1636PI     TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
           MOVE CHAR-10PI       TO NORMAL-PRINT.
           MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-61 TO ESC-TEXT-61.
           MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-60 TO ESC-TEXT-60.

      *----------  OPEN OUTPUT FILE
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"       TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
           MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"      TO OVRPRTF-FILE.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT DISC-PRT.
      *----------  PRINT HEADER PAGE
           MOVE "DHDR02.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME,
              FNUM, HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
           IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
                NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               WRITE PRT-REC FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0
               WRITE PRT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61 AFTER ADVANCING 0.
           IF HD-RET-CODE NOT = 0
               DISPLAY "THDRPT ERROR".

           MOVE "*************************" TO COMPARE-VARIABLES.
       401-READ-LOOP.
           READ SORTED-PRINT-FILE
                 AT END     PERFORM 480-BREAK-TOTAL THRU 489-EXIT
                            GO TO 490-REPORT-TOTALS.
           IF PO-SORT
              GO TO 405-COMPARE-PO.
           IF CLASS-OPTION AND SRTD-SUB-CLASS = COMPARE-CLASS
              GO TO 410-MOVE-FIELDS.
           IF SUBD-OPTION AND SRTD-SUB-DET = COMPARE-DET
              GO TO 410-MOVE-FIELDS.
           IF ADDTL-OPTION AND SRTD-ADDL-DATA = COMPARE-ADDL
              GO TO 410-MOVE-FIELDS.

       402-SEPARATE-BREAKS.
      *----------  DO NOT PRINT BREAK TOTALS FOR FIRST READ
           IF COMPARE-VARIABLES NOT = "*************************"
              PERFORM 480-BREAK-TOTAL THRU 489-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 3 LINES.
           ADD 3                      TO LINE-CTR.

      *----------  RESET COMPARE VARIABLES
           MOVE SRTD-SUB-CLASS        TO COMPARE-CLASS.
           MOVE SRTD-SUB-DET          TO COMPARE-DET.
           MOVE SRTD-ADDL-DATA        TO COMPARE-ADDL.
           MOVE SRTD-PO               TO COMPARE-PO.

           GO TO 410-MOVE-FIELDS.

       405-COMPARE-PO.
           IF SRTD-PO NOT = COMPARE-PO
              GO TO 402-SEPARATE-BREAKS.
      *************************************************************
      *       PRINT THE DETAIL LINE FOR EACH RECORD.              *
      *************************************************************
       410-MOVE-FIELDS.
           IF LINE-CTR > 55
              PERFORM 470-NEW-PAGE THRU 479-EXIT.

           IF SRTD-VALUE > ZEROS
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               GO TO 401-READ-LOOP.

           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SRTD-ITEM             TO LINE1-ITEM.
           MOVE SRTD-SUB-CLASS        TO LINE1-CLASS.
           MOVE SRTD-VENDOR           TO LINE1-VENDOR.
           MOVE SRTD-PO               TO LINE1-PO.
           MOVE SRTD-CODE             TO LINE1-CODE.
           MOVE SRTD-SUB-DET          TO LINE1-SUB.
           MOVE SRTD-ADDL-DATA        TO LINE1-ADDTL.
           MOVE SRTD-DLVR             TO LINE1-TOTAL.
           MOVE SRTD-UNPAID           TO LINE1-QTY.
           MOVE SRTD-VALUE            TO LINE1-VALUE.
           MOVE SRTD-UM               TO LINE1-UM.
           IF SRTD-DATE-RCVD = SPACES
              MOVE SPACES             TO LINE1-RCVR-DATE
           ELSE
              MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
              MOVE SRTD-DATE-RCVD TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
              DISPLAY "SORT DATE=" SRTD-DATE-RCVD " " SRTD-DATE-RCVD-CN
              CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
              MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT     TO LINE1-RCVR-DATE.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           ADD 1                      TO LINE-CTR.

           ADD SRTD-DLVR          TO TOTAL-RCV-WS.
           ADD SRTD-UNPAID            TO TOTAL-RNP-WS.
           ADD SRTD-VALUE             TO TOTAL-VAL-WS.

           GO TO 401-READ-LOOP.
       470-NEW-PAGE.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           ADD 1                      TO PAGE-NUM.
           MOVE "O P E N   R E C E I V E R S   R E P O R T"
                                      TO HEAD1-TITLE.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.

           MOVE 1                     TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO HEAD2-TIME.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT        TO HEAD2-DATE.
           MOVE "by "                 TO HEAD2-TITLE.
           IF CLASS-OPTION
              MOVE "CLASS     "       TO HEAD2-OPTION.
           IF SUBD-OPTION
              MOVE "SUB DETAIL"       TO HEAD2-OPTION.
           IF ADDTL-OPTION
              MOVE "ADDTL DATA"       TO HEAD2-OPTION.
           MOVE "PAGE "               TO HEAD2-PAGE.
           MOVE PAGE-NUM              TO HEAD2-PAGE-NO.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE "SELECTED: 1) "       TO HEAD3-SELECTED.
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (1) = "??????"
              MOVE SPACES             TO HEAD3-ENTRY1
           ELSE
              MOVE ACCEPT-CHOICE (1)  TO HEAD3-ENTRY1.
           MOVE "   2) "              TO HEAD3-2.
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (2) = "??????"
              MOVE SPACES             TO HEAD3-ENTRY2
           ELSE
              MOVE ACCEPT-CHOICE (2)  TO HEAD3-ENTRY2.
           MOVE "   3) "              TO HEAD3-3.
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (3) = "??????"
              MOVE SPACES             TO HEAD3-ENTRY3
           ELSE
              MOVE ACCEPT-CHOICE (3)  TO HEAD3-ENTRY3.
           MOVE "   4) "              TO HEAD3-4.
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (4) = "??????"
              MOVE SPACES             TO HEAD3-ENTRY4
           ELSE
              MOVE ACCEPT-CHOICE (4)  TO HEAD3-ENTRY4.
           MOVE "   5) "              TO HEAD3-5.
           IF ACCEPT-CHOICE (5) = "??????"
              MOVE SPACES             TO HEAD3-ENTRY5
           ELSE
              MOVE ACCEPT-CHOICE (5)  TO HEAD3-ENTRY5.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE "CLOSING DATE:  "     TO HEAD3A-TITLE.
           MOVE "-"                   TO HEAD3A-DASH.
           MOVE RCVR-YEAR             TO HEAD3A-YEAR.
           MOVE RCVR-MONTH            TO HEAD3A-MONTH.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE "PO"                  TO HEAD4-PO.
           MOVE "ITEM"                TO HEAD4-ITEM.
           MOVE "LAST"                TO HEAD4-LAST.
           MOVE "VENDOR"              TO HEAD4-VENDOR.
           MOVE "CORP CODE"           TO HEAD4-CODE.
           MOVE "CLASS"               TO HEAD4-CLASS.
           MOVE "SUB"                 TO HEAD4-SUB.
           MOVE "ADDTL"               TO HEAD4-ADDTL.
           MOVE "TOTAL QTY"           TO HEAD4-TOTAL.
           MOVE "QTY RCVD"            TO HEAD4-QTY.
           MOVE "UM"                  TO HEAD4-UM.
           MOVE "DOLLAR"              TO HEAD4-DOLLAR.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 4 LINES.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.

           MOVE "RCVR"                TO HEAD5-RCVR.
           MOVE "CODE"                TO HEAD5-CODE.
           MOVE "DETAIL"              TO HEAD5-DETAIL.
           MOVE "DATA"                TO HEAD5-DATA.
           MOVE "RCVD"                TO HEAD5-RCVD.
           MOVE "NOT PAID"            TO HEAD5-NOTPAID.
           MOVE "VALUE"               TO HEAD5-VALUE.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE            TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.

           MOVE 12                    TO LINE-CTR.
       479-EXIT.  EXIT.
      *************************************************************
      *      PRINT TOTALS FOR EACH GROUP BREAK                    *
      *************************************************************
       480-BREAK-TOTAL.
           IF TOTAL-VAL-WS = ZEROS
               GO TO 489-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE "===========" TO DASHES1, DASHES2.
           MOVE "==============="      TO DASHES3.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE             TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE TOTAL-RCV-WS           TO TOTAL-RCV.
           MOVE TOTAL-RNP-WS           TO TOTAL-RNP.
           MOVE TOTAL-VAL-WS           TO TOTAL-VAL.
           MOVE "TOTAL  "              TO TOTAL-TOTAL.
           MOVE " *"                   TO TOTAL-END.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE             TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.

           ADD TOTAL-RCV-WS TO RPTOT-RCV-WS.
           ADD TOTAL-RNP-WS TO RPTOT-RNP-WS.
           ADD TOTAL-VAL-WS TO RPTOT-VAL-WS.
           MOVE ZEROES TO TOTAL-RCV-WS, TOTAL-RNP-WS, TOTAL-VAL-WS.
           ADD 3                       TO LINE-CTR.
       489-EXIT.  EXIT.

      *************************************************************
      *      PRINT FINAL REPORT TOTALS FOR ALL GROUPS             *
      *************************************************************
       490-REPORT-TOTALS.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE "REPORT TOTAL  "       TO RPTOT-RPTOT.
           MOVE RPTOT-RCV-WS           TO RPTOT-RCV.
           MOVE RPTOT-RNP-WS           TO RPTOT-RNP.
           MOVE RPTOT-VAL-WS           TO RPTOT-VAL.
           MOVE " **"                  TO RPTOT-END.
           MOVE PRINT-LINE             TO PRT-LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.
       499-EXIT.  EXIT.
       800-READ-MSTORERM.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CORPCODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
       809-EXIT.  EXIT.
       COPY OVRPFCALL IN COPYLIB.
      ************************************************************
      ************************************************************
      *                    B L O W U P                           *
      *     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
      *     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
      *     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
      *                                                          *
      *     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
      *     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
      *                                                          *
      *         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
      ************************************************************
      ************************************************************
       990-BLOWUP.
      *----------  PURGE THE FILE
      *    MOVE SPACES TO COMMAND.
      *    MOVE "PURGE INVDISC.PUB,TEMP" TO COMMAND.
      *    CALL INTRINSIC "COMMAND" USING COMMAND-IMAGE, COMMAND-ERROR,
      *                                   COMMAND-PARM.
           MOVE PO-WORK-AREA TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
       999-EXIT.  EXIT.
